Two presentation improvements in Infusion Studio v4:

POLISH 1 — In src/app/(dashboard)/brew-logs/page.tsx, group logs by date with sticky headers. Import { isToday, isYesterday, format } from 'date-fns'.

Add a groupByDate helper:
function groupByDate(logs: BrewLogEntry[]) {
  const map = new Map<string, BrewLogEntry[]>();
  logs.forEach((log) => {
    const d = new Date(log.brewedAt);
    const key = isToday(d) ? 'Today' : isYesterday(d) ? 'Yesterday' : format(d, 'dd MMM yyyy');
    if (!map.has(key)) map.set(key, []);
    map.get(key)!.push(log);
  });
  return map;
}

Render each group with a <h3> date header above its <ul> of log items.

