Add a brew streak tracker to the Infusion Studio dashboard.

1. In src/app/api/dashboard/route.ts, add a streak calculation to the Promise.all:
   prisma.brewLog.findMany({
     where: { userId },
     orderBy: { brewedAt: 'desc' },
     take: 60,
     select: { brewedAt: true },
   })

   Then compute streak:
   function calcStreak(logs: { brewedAt: Date }[]): number {
     if (!logs.length) return 0;
     const days = [...new Set(logs.map((l) => l.brewedAt.toISOString().slice(0, 10)))].sort().reverse();
     const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
     const yesterday = new Date(Date.now() - 86400000).toISOString().slice(0, 10);
     if (days[0] !== today && days[0] !== yesterday) return 0;
     let streak = 1;
     for (let i = 1; i < days.length; i++) {
       const prev = new Date(days[i - 1]);
       const curr = new Date(days[i]);
       if ((prev.getTime() - curr.getTime()) === 86400000) streak++;
       else break;
     }
     return streak;
   }
   Include brewStreak in the JSON response.

2. Update the DashboardStats type in src/types/index.ts to add: brewStreak: number;

3. In src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/page.tsx, add a streak StatCard after the Favorites card:
